{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>宏福苑大火奪去十名外傭的生命，包括當日帶着五歲女童煦翹逃生的菲傭 Maryan。《集誌社》訪問 Maryan 的同性伴侶 Cristine，大火發生前，兩人才剛慶祝拍拖三週年，原定去年 12 月到菲律賓舉行結婚儀式；Maryan 也打算辭工返鄉，但最終命喪火海，遺下十歲兒子。<br/><br/>過去一年，Cristine 由起初以淚洗面，到上樓取回遺物後內心稍為釋懷，「我慢慢接受她已離去」。後頸和手腕的紋身、手指上的訂婚和承諾戒指，皆是愛的見證；她也一步步實踐以往與 Maryan 的共同願望，買房子、照顧她的家人，「我告訴自己，即使她不在，我也能做到。」時日過去，但感覺猶在，回憶也沒有消失。「不論發生什麼事，不論她身在何方，我仍然愛她，很掛念她。」<br/><br/>文字報道：<a href=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/%e5%ae%8f%e7%a6%8f%e8%8b%91%e5%a4%a7%e7%81%ab%e4%b8%80%e5%b9%b4-maryan-%e7%b5%90%e5%a9%9a%e5%a4%a2%e7%a2%8e-%e6%84%9b%e4%be%b6%e8%be%a6%e5%a9%9a%e7%a6%ae-%e5%90%91%e9%81%ba%e7%85%a7%e8%a8%b1%e8%ab%be/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">宏福苑大火一年｜外傭 Maryan 回鄉結婚夢碎　愛侶兌現承諾辦婚禮　向遺照許諾「永不會忘記」</a><br/><a href=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/%e5%ae%8f%e7%a6%8f%e8%8b%91%e5%a4%a7%e7%81%ab%e4%b8%80%e5%b9%b4-%e5%b7%a5%e6%ac%8a%e6%9c%83%e8%a8%aa%e8%8f%b2%e5%82%ad%e9%81%ba%e5%b1%ac-%e5%a7%90%e6%8a%b1%e7%b4%80%e5%bf%b5%e5%86%8a%e7%97%9b%e5%93%ad/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">宏福苑大火一年｜工權會訪菲傭遺屬　二姐緊抱紀念冊痛哭：只有公義能帶來平靜　</a></p>\n<p></p>\n<figure><p>\n</p></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"237\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Payme-500x237.png\" width=\"500\"/></figure>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T13:23:58.765868+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":410,"images":1,"source":"The Collective HK","fallback":"rss-http-error","origin":"wordpress-public-posts","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T12:59:03+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T01:31:49.045320+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T13:17:20.599071+00:00","content_hash":"65834f4762792bd0931d16cf733ccf647c4bf4848a9f3d97f1f0c54d5a63bae2","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 520","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}